{"id":"e6a39a4f73051784","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-knuth-bendix-criterion.md","title":"终止TRS的临界对合流判据","display":"thm-knuth-bendix-criterion — 终止TRS的临界对合流判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-knuth-bendix-criterion","aliases":["56-thm-knuth-bendix-criterion"],"display":"thm-knuth-bendix-criterion — 终止TRS的临界对合流判据","depends_on":["[[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]","[[56-df-confluent]]","[[56-df-critical-pair]]","[[56-df-joinable]]","[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]"],"source_section":"§2.7 Theorem 2.7.16","source_printed_pages":"55","source_ocr_blocks":[76],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-knuth-bendix-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-knuth-bendix-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-knuth-bendix-criterion — 终止TRS的临界对合流判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4176ebfcf797c869\" href=\"?note=4176ebfcf797c869\" title=\"56-df-critical-pair\">56-df-critical-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.7 Theorem 2.7.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"55"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>工作于 ZFC。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li>SN、合流、CP、Join见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4176ebfcf797c869\" href=\"?note=4176ebfcf797c869\" title=\"56-df-critical-pair\">56-df-critical-pair</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a>；两引理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SN}(T,\\to_R)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,\\to_R)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\mathrm{Join}(T,\\to_R,s,t)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SN}(T,\\to_R)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,\\to_R)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\mathrm{Join}(T,\\to_R,s,t)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点表述Knuth–Bendix临界对合流判据，文件名与该数学内容一致；有限成功补全过程的正确性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"2735feec3db7f175\" href=\"?note=2735feec3db7f175\" title=\"56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness\">56-thm-knuth-bendix-correctness</a> 单独陈述。原书陈述已核对，推导已复核：临界对引理给局部合流，SN配合Newman给合流；反向由合流直接推出。删除了无条件“KB总能成功输出完备系统”的错误断言；原书§2.7.3 p57、§7.4 p279明确允许无限运行或定向失败。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-strongly-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"251992a231a52348","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-critical-pair","status":"resolved","id":"4176ebfcf797c869","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-critical-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-newman-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[H